<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn feedlot cattle not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested in a slow trade on a live basis, compared with Tuesday;s close, USDA said.</p>
<p>On a cCarcass basis, steers were not well tested and heifers not tested.</p>
<p>Steers:  mostly Choice 2-3 1325-1350 lbs 107.25</p>
<p>Reported sales for Wednesday: 300  Week to Date: 3,700</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
